 runtime
 IdleScreen product package and router: pulls in the modular host stack and
 provides `idlescreen` — `idlescreen <component>` execs component binaries
 (cli, tui, studio, cosmic); `idlescreen <verb>` forwards daemon commands to
 idle-cli; `idlescreen install` manages components via dnf/apt. Removing this
 package removes the installed product stack; user config under ~/.config/idle
 is left in place.

